  <p id="c-liangshu-027-wanghuan-daughter-and-yinrui:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-027-wanghuan-daughter-and-yinrui:p001:m0000" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>妻<persName id="c-liangshu-027-wanghuan-daughter-and-yinrui:p001:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">王奐</persName><persName id="c-liangshu-027-wanghuan-daughter-and-yinrui:p001:m0004" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAG">女</persName>。<persName id="c-liangshu-027-wanghuan-daughter-and-yinrui:p001:m0006" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>爲雍州刺史、鎮北將軍，乃言於朝，以<persName id="c-liangshu-027-wanghuan-daughter-and-yinrui:p001:m0024" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>爲鎮北長史、河南太守。<persName id="c-liangshu-027-wanghuan-daughter-and-yinrui:p001:m0036" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>誅，<persName id="c-liangshu-027-wanghuan-daughter-and-yinrui:p001:m0039" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>並見害。</p>
</text>
